            "sid": "LEV 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "OMWAMI naboolela Musa naHaruni ari ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olwa omundu aba nali nelifwimbe khwikhoba liomubilikwe, kata likamba, kata eshitayi, mana nishikwa oluumbe Iwohuchele khwikhoba liomubilikwe, aleerwe ewaHaruni omukuhani kata ewomulala owokhubaanabe abakuhani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye omukuhani ahenjelesie haluumbe oluli khwikhoba liomubilikwe; ne amaswa akali haluumbe nikaba nikalabile, khandi haluumbe tsana nihalolekha shinga ahahobooshe mwikhoba liomubilikwe, kho noluumbe Iwobuchele; omukuhani amuhenjelesie narumbula mbu nowobukaali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne eshitayi eshio nishiba nishili eshilafu khwikhoba liomubilikwe, nishiralolekha shinga eshihobooshe mwikhoba, kata amaswa nikaralabile ta, kho omukuhani amwikalile tsindaalo musaafu oyo ouli noluumbe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana khunyanga yomusaafu omukuhani amuhenjelesie; mana lola, naba nalola mbu oluumbe lwaakaame yaho, oluumbe tsana nilureemeeta okhulanda khwikhoba ta, kho omukuhani amwikalile tsindaalo tsindi musaafu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana omukuhani amuhenjelesie khandi khunyanga yomusaafu, ne naba nalola mbu oluumbe lutiitiihe, ohlumbe tsana nilureemeetile okhulanda khwikhoba ta, kho omukuhani arumbule mbu nomusiiyikhu; nelikamba butswa; kho yoosie tsingubotsie, abe omusiiyikhu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa likamba niliba nililandile khwikhoba olunyuma Iwokhwiolosilia omukuhani khulwa okhusiiywa, kho yeelolosilie omukuhani khandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana omukuhani ahenje, ne lola, likamba niliba nililandile khwikhoba, kho omukuhani arumbule mbu nowobukaali; nibwo obuchele.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
