          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naye omukuhani ahenje, ne nihaba nihalolekha nihali hasi welikhoba lindi, amaswa kaho nikalabile, kho omukuhani arumbule mbu nowobukaali; noluumbe Iwobuchele, olurubuushe khwibure. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne omukuhani naba nahenjelesia, ne amaswa amalafu kabulakhwo kata niharali hasi welikhoba lindi ta, ne nihatiitiihe, kho omukuhani amwikalile tsindaalo musaafu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa nihaba nihalandile khwikhoba, kho omukuhani arumbule mbu nowobukaali; nilwo oluumbe tsana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne eshitayi nishiba nishili butswa shirio, nishiralandile ta, kho neimbala yelibure tsana; omukuhani arumbule mbu nomusiiyikhu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.23"
            ]
          }
