            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne omubili nikuba nikuli nende habundu ahasambilwe khwikhoba, mana ahasambilwe nihakhobokha mana nihakwa eshitayi, eshiranzayi eshilafukhwo, kata eshilafu, ",
