          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa omukuhani naba nahenjelesia, ne amaswa amalafu kabula khushitayi, kata nishirali hasi welikhoba ta, habula mbu shitiitihanga, kho omukuhani amwikalile tsindaalo musaafu. ",
