            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana khunyanga yomusaafu omukuhani amuhenjelesiej ne nishiba nishilandile khwikhoba, kho omukuhani arumbule mbu nowobukaali; noluumbe Iwobuchele ",
