          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kho omukuhani ahenjelesie; ne ebitayi ebili khwikhoba liomubilikwe nibiba nibili ebilafukhwo butswa, neshikhombamoosi eshirubuushe khwikhoba; nomusiiyikhu.",
          "type": "text",
