              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Owobuchele mwene ouli noluumbe tsana, arandule inguboye, naboholola liswi, niyeefuunikha omunwa, nalanjilisinjia ari Owobukaali! Owobukaali! ",
          "type": "text",
