              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne omukuhani naba nahenga, ne haluumbe shihalandilekhwo mungubo eyo, kata mubuusi bwobulunji kata mubwobuchiikha, kata mushindu eshiakholelwa liseelo ta, ",
