              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana eshindu shioluumbe nishimalile okhwosibwa, omukuhani ashihenje; ne haluumbe niharakalukhaane obukondo, kata olwa haluumbe niharalandile ta, neshiomusilo; oshisambile mumulilo; nelinyanyukho, kata niliba imbeli kata emukongo.",
