        },
        {
          "text": "Ne niluba nilushilolekha khandi mungubo tsana, kata mubuusi bwobulunji kata mubwobuchiikha, kata mushindu shiosi shieliseelo, kho burubuushe; osambe shieneshio eshia oluumbe lulimwo nomulilo. ",
